title: The Iron Banner
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: iron_front_formed == 1 and iron_front_timer = 0
on-arrival: iron_front_timer = 7; month_actions += 1; month_actions -= 1 if harzburg_front_time = time; banner_militarization_cost = 2 if banner_militancy > 0.1 else banner_militarization_cost = 1; banner_militarization_cost = 3 if banner_militancy > 0.25
card-image: img/iron_front.png
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs, antifascism
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/tnoreference.png";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}

= The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span>

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span> is our new anti-<span style="color: #7A3C00;">Sovereigntists</span> coordination front, consisting of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>, the trade unions, and the the Banners. How should we use the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span>?

[? if commons_marcher < 45 or commons_marcher < commons_royalist or commons_marcher < commons_collectivist : Unfortunately, the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span>'s effectiveness is dragged down by the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>'s unpopularity, as the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> is no longer the dominant party among the workers. Many the Banners members have left, and many workers are not interested. ?]

- @defense: Rally for defense against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Sovereigntists</span> with the the Banners.
- @pacifism: Rally for pacifism, against nationalism and war.
- @republic: Rally to save the democratic republic against <span style="color: #7A3C00;">dictatorship</span>.
- @wtb: Rally for economic change and the WTB-Plan.
- @antisemitism
- @easy_discard

@defense
subtitle: -[+ banner_militarization_cost +] resources
choose-if: resources >= banner_militarization_cost
view-if: not banner_explode
on-arrival: resources -= banner_militarization_cost; banner_strength += 50; banner_militancy += 0.05; unionist_relation -= 3 if strife < 5; ddp_relation -= 3 if strife < 5; lvp_relation -= 3 if strife < 5

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span> rallies for the militant defense of the republic against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Sovereigntists</span> paramilitaries, strengthening the the Banners.

[? if not concord_leave_banner and not banner_exit: [? if strife < 5: The [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] decries the militarization of the the Banners, and its members are leaving the <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> organization. ?][? if strife >= 5: Seeing the strife that has filled the Commonwealth's streets, the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] and [? if not lvp_formed:<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] seem to be convinced that it is necessary for the the Banners to be militarized, and mute their criticisms. ?] ?]

@pacifism
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 5 if pacifism >= 3; commons_marcher += 5*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4; disfavored_marcher += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4; burgher_marcher += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span> rallies against nationalism and war.

@republic
on-arrival: pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); democratization += 1; commons_marcher += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; disfavored_marcher += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; burgher_marcher += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; ddp_left += 0.5 if democratization >= 4; lvp_left += 0.5 if democratization >= 4

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span> rallies in defense of the democratic republic and against <span style="color: #7A3C00;">dictatorship</span>.

@wtb
view-if: wtb_adopted == 1
choose-if: return_to_normalcy = 0 and (wtb_implemented >= wtb_rally or (not marcher_in_government and not marcher_toleration))
unavailable-subtitle: [? if return_to_normalcy == 1: The economic crisis is largely over now, and the public is no longer interested in hearing about it. ?] [? if wtb_rally > wtb_implemented: Rhetoric alone has its limits; further implementation of the WTB plan is necessary to continue an effective campaign. ?]
on-arrival: commons_marcher += 4*(1-dissent); disfavored_marcher += 4*(1-dissent); burgher_marcher += 2*(1-dissent); guild_marcher += 1*(1-dissent); landed_marcher += 1*(1-dissent); commons_marcher += 4*(1-dissent) if wtb_implemented; disfavored_marcher += 4*(1-dissent) if wtb_implemented; landed_marcher += 2*(1-dissent) if wtb_implemented; burgher_marcher += 3*(1-dissent) if wtb_implemented; guild_marcher += 2*(1-dissent) if wtb_implemented; wtb_rally += 1

The WTB-Plan is the rallying point for the entire <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> and its affiliated organizations, including the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span>. [? if not wtb_implemented: However, many still believe that the plan is merely an empty slogan and will remain skeptical until we actually implement it. ?]

@antisemitism
title: Rally against antisemitism and in defense of <span style="color: #005EB8;">Jewish</span> Germans.
view-if: confronting_antisemitism > 1
on-arrival: nationalism -= 4*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 1.5*(1-dissent); confronting_antisemitism += 1; commons_royalist -= 4*(1-dissent); disfavored_royalist -= 4*(1-dissent); ddp_left += 0.5; lvp_left += 1

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> and other <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> political movements are increasingly turning their hatred against the <span style="color: #005EB8;">Jewish</span> community of the Commonwealth. The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span> rallies in defense of individual <span style="color: #005EB8;">Jews</span> and the broader community against violence.
